  "albumInformation": "<p><span style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #363636; font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 15px;\">Welcome to the Song-O-Phone! Each track represents a link in the chain, begun by sending Song I to a single person. Each </span><span class=\"peekaboo-text\" style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #363636; font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 15px;\">artist</span><span class=\"bcTruncateMore\" style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #363636; font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 15px;\"><span class=\"peekaboo-text\"> only heard the version directly before them when recording their track, then had 24 hours to complete theirs. There are three chains, numbered with I, II, III... and 2, 3, 4...</span> and lettered A, B, C.</span></p>",
